# APT snapshots for required packages installed directly by HiddenVM. Compatible with the currently supported Tails version.
# Currently, 'trixie' (used as the base in the current Tails version) is adequate for most packages. Linux-headers may use a more cutting edge source, catered to when needed.

deb [check-valid-until=no] tor+https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20260211 trixie main contrib
deb [check-valid-until=no] tor+https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian-security/20260211 trixie-security main contrib

# VirtualBox (Debian release should match Tails's current Debian version)
deb [trusted=yes] tor+https://download.virtualbox.org/virtualbox/debian trixie contrib
